OL,3,AGreens concede Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election as result set to be
OL,5,Adeclared
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Green Party has conceded in the
OL,8,FHolborn and St Pancras by-election, a
OL,9,Fparty spokesperson says
OL,11,F"It is clear now we will come a close
OL,12,Fsecond in this by-election", the
OL,13,Fspokesperson adds
OL,15,FCounting appears to have finished and
OL,16,Fthe result is set to be declared
OL,17,Fshortly
OL,19,FThe turnout in Thursday's vote is
OL,20,Fconfirmed as 38.76%, which is lower
OL,21,Fthan the 2024 General Election
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
