OL,3,AGreens concede Holborn and St Pancras
OL,4,Aby-election as result set to be
OL,5,Adeclared
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe north London seat became vacant
OL,8,Fafter former Prime Minister Keir
OL,9,FStarmer announced he was standing down
OL,10,Ffrom the House of Commons last month
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
