OL,3,APolanski failed to show leadership over
OL,4,AZionism motion, ex-Green leader says
OL,5,
OL,6,FZack Polanski failed to show leadership
OL,7,Fover a motion passed by Green Party
OL,8,Fmembers declaring Zionism a form of
OL,9,Fracism, the party's former leader
OL,10,FCaroline Lucas has told the BBC.
OL,12,FLucas told Newsnight that the party's
OL,13,Fcurrent leader, who did not attend the
OL,14,Fdebate on the motion at the Green
OL,15,FParty's annual conference in Brighton,
OL,16,F"should have been there and he should
OL,17,Fhave voted".
OL,19,FShe described the motion, which defined
OL,20,FZionism as an ideology supporting "an
OL,21,Fethnonationalist Jewish state", as
OL,22,F"dangerous" and "divisive".
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG5/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
