OL,3,AADHD and autism at risk of
OL,4,Aover-diagnosis, says government review
OL,5,
OL,6,FThere is a risk of people being
OL,7,Fover-diagnosed with ADHD and autism, an
OL,8,Fofficial review in England has found.
OL,10,FExperts said a rise in diagnoses over
OL,11,Fthe past 25 years meant cases now
OL,12,Fappear to be outstripping the expected
OL,13,Fnumber in the population for some
OL,14,Fyounger age groups.
OL,16,FThe review called for tougher
OL,17,Fregulation of private firms offering
OL,18,Fassessments for the NHS, saying they
OL,19,Fhad concerns about quality and
OL,20,Fconsistency, and a ban on advertising.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
