OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFort Hood attacker's execution by
OL,4,Afiring squad will be livestreamed,
OL,5,APentagon says
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt is believed it would be the first
OL,8,Fpublic execution in the US in almost a
OL,9,Fcentury. The decision to livestream it
OL,10,Fis "unprecedented in the modern era"
OL,11,Fand "on uncertain legal terrain," said
OL,12,FJohn Mills, a lawyer who works with
OL,13,Finmates sentenced to death.
OL,15,F"We'll make sure that people are able
OL,16,Fto watch it, that it's public," Hegseth
OL,17,Fsaid. "People need to understand that
OL,18,Fthere's serious consequences for these
OL,19,Ftypes of things."
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
